<title>SPAIN: Spain Treasury shortens loan bid deadline.</title>
<headline>Spain Treasury shortens loan bid deadline.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Treasury said on Monday it had brought forward the deadline at the auction for loans of up to one trillion pesetas from financial entities.</p>
<p>It said the deadline to present bids, which started on Friday July 4, will end on Tuesday July 15 at 1200 GMT and not on July 17 as initially indicated.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
